flowchart LR
  L[First launch] --> V[Value and privacy boundary]
  V --> N[Add Person or import]
  N --> E[Validate and atomically save]
  E --> DASH[Dashboard and next occurrence]
  DASH --> CAL[Calendar]
  DASH --> ST[Message Studio]
  CAL --> ST
  subgraph Reminder loop
    DASH --> RP[Reminder preferences]
    RP --> RS[Permission and reconciliation]
    RS --> TN[Notification]
    TN --> ST
  end
  ST --> MAN[Manual edit and save]
  ST --> ENT{Entitled AI}
  ENT -- No --> LOCK[Explain gate and continue manually]
  LOCK --> MAN
  ENT -- Yes --> PROV{Provider ready}
  PROV -- BYOK or Nano --> GEN[Generate candidate]
  PROV -- No --> UNAV[Unavailable and continue manually]
  GEN --> REV[Human review]
  UNAV --> MAN
  MAN --> REV
  REV --> CH{Channel}
  CH --> WA[WhatsApp handoff]
  CH --> SMS[SMS composer]
  CH --> SHARE[Copy or share]
  WA --> RET[Return and explicit answer]
  SMS --> RET
  SHARE --> RET
  RET --> HIST[History: confirmed, not sent or unknown]
  RET -- no return --> UNKNOWN[Outcome unknown]
  UNKNOWN --> HIST
  subgraph Account paths
    SET[Settings] --> AUTH[Account]
    AUTH --> BUY[Purchase or restore]
    AUTH --> BACK[Backup and restore]
    AUTH --> DEL[Export or deletion]
  end
  click L "../06-user-experience.md" "Detailed journeys"
  click ST "../02-feature-specifications.md" "Feature contracts"
